# Who GitHub asks for review when a path is touched.
#
# Two teams work on this repository, so the point of this file is less "approval"
# and more "the other team finds out before it lands". Owners must have write
# access to the repository; a handle that does not, is silently ignored by GitHub.
#
# To split ownership, uncomment the lines below and replace the placeholder handles
# with the real ones, most specific rule last (the last match wins).

